# Reduce Hero Gap

This plan addresses the massive ~500px gap between the "Get Started" buttons and the "Trusted by" logos section. The previous attempt moved the text too high into the crystal visual; this plan focuses on pulling the lower sections UP instead.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change focuses specifically on the space *below* the buttons. The "One Library..." tagline will remain in its original position to avoid overlapping the crystal.

## Proposed Changes

### Prism Page

#### [MODIFY] [prism.astro](file:///Users/pratik.giramkar/orca-docs/src/pages/prism.astro)

- **Hero Height**: Reduce `min-height` of `.prism-hero` slightly to tighten the container around the video.
- **Trust Band Overlap**: Increase the negative `margin-top` of `.brand-proof-band` (desktop) from `-13vw` to `-18vw`. 
- **Logo Positioning**: Adjust the `top` position of `.brand-proof-content` from `68%` to `58%` to move the logos higher in the gradient band.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Open [prism page](http://10.100.13.24:4321/prism).
2. Verify that the "One Library..." text is NOT overlapping the crystal.
3. Verify that the gap below the buttons is visibly reduced.
4. Verify that the logos are still clearly visible and not overlapping the buttons.
